{"id":"4a8ab8e4bad7b12d","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma.md","title":"Generalized Diagonal Lemma","display":"thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma — Generalized Diagonal Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma","aliases":["89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma"],"display":"thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma — Generalized Diagonal Lemma","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]","[[89-df-diagonal-lemma]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma — Generalized Diagonal Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e7227755a8473e0\" href=\"?note=2e7227755a8473e0\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus\">89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2695165f0444a6d1\" href=\"?note=2695165f0444a6d1\" title=\"89-df-diagonal-lemma\">89-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,m\\in\\omega\">\\(k,m\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec y\\in\\mathsf V^k\">\\(\\vec y\\in\\mathsf V^k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec z\\in\\mathsf V^m\">\\(\\vec z\\in\\mathsf V^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inj}(\\vec y\\frown\\vec z)\">\\(\\operatorname{Inj}(\\vec y\\frown\\vec z)\\)</span>。原记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z_1,\\ldots,z_m\">\\(z_1,\\ldots,z_m\\)</span> 依次为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\vec z)_0,\\ldots,(\\vec z)_{m-1}\">\\((\\vec z)_0,\\ldots,(\\vec z)_{m-1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^k\">\\(\\vec P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i&lt;k\\ (\\mathrm{FV}(P_i)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec y)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec z))\">\\(\\forall i&lt;k\\ (\\mathrm{FV}(P_i)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec y)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec z))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>固定原 Gödel 编码、数词及同时避免捕获替换；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner S_i\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner S_i\\urcorner\\)</span> 编码开放公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_i\">\\(S_i\\)</span> 本身，不编码参数实例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span> 是既有 PA 证明关系，允许开放公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\exists\\vec S\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^k\\ \\forall i&lt;k\\\n\\left[\\mathrm{FV}(S_i)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec z)\\land\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\n\\left(S_i\\leftrightarrow\nP_i[\\vec y:=\\langle\\overline{\\ulcorner S_j\\urcorner}\\mid j&lt;k\\rangle]\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\exists\\vec S\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^k\\ \\forall i&lt;k\\\n\\left[\\mathrm{FV}(S_i)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec z)\\land\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\n\\left(S_i\\leftrightarrow\nP_i[\\vec y:=\\langle\\overline{\\ulcorner S_j\\urcorner}\\mid j&lt;k\\rangle]\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 3 章，印刷页 53–55；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n这是带参数的同时对角化，复用单句对角引理的编码机制；单句无参数的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2695165f0444a6d1\" href=\"?note=2695165f0444a6d1\" title=\"89-df-diagonal-lemma\">89-df-diagonal-lemma</a> 不能直接当作同一签名使用。原书通过表示代入与对角函数给出构造；证明在这些编码函数上进行有限的同时自代入。若输入均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>），可取相同复杂度的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_i\">\\(S_i\\)</span>。本条引用原书证明，编码函数的逐条 PA 表示证明未在此重新展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"2e7227755a8473e0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"2695165f0444a6d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"2695165f0444a6d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 3 章，印刷页 53–55；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n这是带参数的同时对角化，复用单句对角引理的编码机制；单句无参数的 [[89-df-diagonal-lemma]] 不能直接当作同一签名使用。原书通过表示代入与对角函数给出构造；证明在这些编码函数上进行有限的同时自代入。若输入均为 $\\Sigma_1$（或 $\\Pi_1$），可取相同复杂度的 $S_i$。本条引用原书证明，编码函数的逐条 PA 表示证明未在此重新展开。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k,m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec y\\in\\mathsf V^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec z\\in\\mathsf V^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Inj}(\\vec y\\frown\\vec z)","display":false},{"tex":"z_1,\\ldots,z_m","display":false},{"tex":"(\\vec z)_0,\\ldots,(\\vec z)_{m-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i<k\\ (\\mathrm{FV}(P_i)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec y)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec z))","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner S_i\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"S_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\exists\\vec S\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^k\\ \\forall i<k\\\n\\left[\\mathrm{FV}(S_i)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec z)\\land\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\n\\left(S_i\\leftrightarrow\nP_i[\\vec y:=\\langle\\overline{\\ulcorner S_j\\urcorner}\\mid j<k\\rangle]\\right)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"S_i","display":false}],"bytes":2015,"backlinks":[{"id":"76b37345e1a3ad95","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a1c8bb923975db7e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]] → [[89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma]] → [[89-thm-lob-internal]] → [[89-thm-lob-theorem]] → [[89-df-reflection-principle]] → [[89-df-gls-logic]]"}],"outgoing":["a257e5b1de6880b7","2e7227755a8473e0","2695165f0444a6d1"]}